{"unit_id":"Garybot126__dsh-subagent-models#card-zh","repo":"Garybot126/dsh-subagent-models","commit":"54d076a08f1d8f8bdfd8b3f3badb6424bb696f63","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-models 是一个面向 DSH 网页端的子代理模型选择插件，可分别设置全局默认和单个对话的覆盖值。它在输入框旁添加入口，并通过 Host 的 agent/request 事件为委派子代理应用 provider、model 和 reasoning effort；顶层会话保持原有模型选择。用户可以从实时模型目录按提供方查找模型、选择模型公布的思考强度，并查看当前生效路线。适合需要让委派任务使用指定模型或强度的 DSH 用户。插件将路由保存到本机 JSON 文件，不需要额外 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:247-257","index.js:305-312","client.js:1295-1303"]}
{"unit_id":"Garybot126__dsh-subagent-models#card-en","repo":"Garybot126/dsh-subagent-models","commit":"54d076a08f1d8f8bdfd8b3f3badb6424bb696f63","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-subagent-models lets DSH web users set global or per-conversation models for delegated agents. A composer chip opens searchable model and reasoning-effort pickers backed by the live catalog. The Host applies the route to child requests and stores settings locally; no extra API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:247-257","index.js:305-312","client.js:1295-1303"]}
