{"unit_id":"Garybot126__dsh-subagent-models#feature-1","repo":"Garybot126/dsh-subagent-models","commit":"54d076a08f1d8f8bdfd8b3f3badb6424bb696f63","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-models 的功能「按对话指定子代理路线」：在输入框旁打开卡片，选择本对话范围并挑选模型。保存后，该对话委派出的子代理请求会使用所选 provider、model 和 reasoning effort。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1295-1303","index.js:234-257"]}
{"unit_id":"Garybot126__dsh-subagent-models#feature-2","repo":"Garybot126/dsh-subagent-models","commit":"54d076a08f1d8f8bdfd8b3f3badb6424bb696f63","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-models 的功能「设置全局子代理默认模型」：从同一张卡片切换到全局默认范围并选择模型。没有单独对话覆盖时，委派子代理请求应用这个默认路线。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:137-153","index.js:234-245"]}
{"unit_id":"Garybot126__dsh-subagent-models#feature-3","repo":"Garybot126/dsh-subagent-models","commit":"54d076a08f1d8f8bdfd8b3f3badb6424bb696f63","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-models 的功能「浏览可用模型」：打开模型菜单并输入搜索词，插件从 DSH 的实时模型目录展示匹配结果并按提供方分组，用户可选择委派任务所用的模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:156-200","client.js:605-629"]}
{"unit_id":"Garybot126__dsh-subagent-models#feature-4","repo":"Garybot126/dsh-subagent-models","commit":"54d076a08f1d8f8bdfd8b3f3badb6424bb696f63","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-subagent-models 的功能「选择模型思考强度」：选择模型后打开强度菜单，可选模型公布的 reasoning effort 或模型默认值；选定值随子代理的模型请求生效。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:175-195","client.js:873-915","index.js:247-257"]}
